      229.92,
      535.68,
      239.28
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Anne Marie Treschlin\u2019 is an early flowering variety with"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      308.88,
      240.24,
      532.56,
      248.88
     ],
     "text": "dull dark green foliage. \u2018Remember Me\u2019 (Cocdestin) and"
